<!--
  `app_name` is deliberately NOT defined here.

  It is generated by `resValue` in `android/app/build.gradle.kts`, so that a
  dev-channel build can call itself "mPlayer (Dev)" — two installs on one
  phone otherwise show the launcher a pair of identical icons. Defining it in
  both places is a duplicate-resource build failure, not a merge.

  The chooser ("Open with") shows an intent-filter's android:label, which is
  why the name has to exist as a resource at all rather than only as the
  application's label.
-->
